---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base
  title="Website Privacy | Dr Kiran’s MyDentist"
  description="How this MyDentist website handles browsing and contact links."
>
  <section class="page-hero wrap">
    <span class="eyebrow">WEBSITE INFORMATION</span>
    <h1>Privacy.</h1>
    <p>Information about using this website and its contact links.</p>
  </section>
  <article class="prose wrap">
    <h2>Browsing this website</h2>
    <p>
      This website provides clinic and treatment information. It does not include a patient account,
      an online booking form or a facility to upload medical records. No advertising trackers are
      enabled.
    </p>
    <h2>Website analytics</h2>
    <p>
      We use Vercel Web Analytics to understand visitor numbers and page views. It provides
      aggregated statistics about visited pages, referral sources, approximate location, browsers
      and devices without using third-party cookies. We do not send contact-link clicks or enquiry
      messages as custom analytics events. Learn more about{' '}
      <a class="text-link" href="https://vercel.com/docs/analytics/privacy-policy">
        Vercel Web Analytics and privacy
      </a>.
    </p>
    <h2>Hosting and technical information</h2>
    <p>
      The service hosting this website may process technical request information, such as IP
      addresses, browser details and requested pages, to deliver and protect the website. The
      hosting provider and its retention settings should be confirmed with the clinic.
    </p>
    <h2>Contacting the clinic</h2>
    <p>
      Phone, email and WhatsApp links open services outside this website. If you use them, the
      information you choose to share is handled through those services and by the clinic. Please
      avoid sending medical records or other sensitive information unless the clinic has explained
      an appropriate way to provide them.
    </p>
    <h2>External services</h2>
    <p>
      WhatsApp and Google Maps operate under their own privacy terms. Opening a link takes you to
      the relevant third-party service.
    </p>
    <h2>Privacy enquiries</h2>
    <p>
      For questions about information you have shared with the clinic, email{' '}
      <a class="text-link" href="mailto:kiransdentalhospital@gmail.com">
        kiransdentalhospital@gmail.com
      </a>
      . This notice describes the website; it is not a statement of the clinic’s clinical-record
      retention practices.
    </p>
  </article>
</Base>
